   $q$How does the speaker feel about going to the tide pools at the start of the poem?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Reluctant, since the speaker grumbles but goes anyway.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Frightened, since the speaker is afraid of the crabs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Proud, since the speaker is in charge of the notebook.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Excited, since the speaker has waited all year to go.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Reluctant, since the speaker grumbles but goes anyway.$q$, $q$The speaker says "I grumbled, but I went," which shows reluctance. Nothing in the poem shows excitement or fear about the trip.$q$, 'draft', '7668d4a1-3bec-54ae-92e0-e86ca1d00d40')
